 peers. Each employee generates $1.4M of free cash flow annually. Stock-based compensation of $878K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 0\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity).","financial_summary":["HIVE Digital Technologies Ltd is a small-cap financial services business with a $435M market cap on $298M of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +158% over the past three years, the kind of sustained demand persistence that marks a compounder.","Returns on capital run at -16% against a 11% cost of capital, which means the business is destroying value with every dollar it reinvests, and -28% gross margins are typical of commodity economics where competitors can replicate the product cheaply.","The business throws off $41M in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 14 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders.","On the balance sheet, the balance sheet carries net cash, which is the gold standard: the business never has to make desperate decisions in a bad year.","Net dilution runs at 45.1% annually, transferring value from owners to stock-based comp, and insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"ROIC sits in the bottom decile among Financial Services peers \u2014 no moat advantage to speak of","sev":"red","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Carries a 202% premium to sector median EV/EBITDA","sev":"amber","cat":"valuation","magnitude":2.0191708376617243},{"text":"Piotroski score 4/9 \u2014 below the median for a healthy business","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Altman Z in the grey zone \u2014 financial health warrants monitoring","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Insiders are overwhelmingly selling (100% sell ratio) \u2014 the people who know the business want less of it","sev":"amber","cat":"insider","ratio":0.0},{"text":"Gross margin trails most Financial Services peers \u2014 competitors appear to have the pricing hand","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Credit cycles and regulatory capital \u2014 losses accumulate invisibly in good years and appear all at once, and the time to worry is when underwriting standards are loosest.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Fintech disintermediation \u2014 neobanks, embedded finance, and blockchain rails are unbundling the fee streams that traditional banks took for granted.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Interest rate regime shifts \u2014 a rapid move in rates can invert the yield curve, crush bond portfolios, and trigger deposit flight simultaneously.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Shares offer a 30% margin of safety against estimated fair value","Market is pricing in lower growth than the company has historically delivered","Trading near the bottom of its 52-week range \u2014 the market is offering a discount","Growing faster than most Financial Services peers \u2014 taking share inside the profit pool"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"HIVE Digital Technologies Ltd (HIVE) (Q2 2027) Earnings Call Highlights: HPC Revenue Hits $40 ...","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/hive-digital-technologies-ltd-hive-170147939.html","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794589307.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.718,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"HIVE (NASDAQ:HIVE) Pivots Toward AI: Can Computing Lift It?","source":"kalkinemedia.com","link":"https://kalkinemedia.com/us/stocks/financial/hive-nasdaqhive-pivots-toward-ai-can-computing-lift-it","date":"2026-11-12","timestamp":1794515700.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.631,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"HIVE Digital Technologies (NASDAQ:HIVE) Given New $5.00 Price Target at Rosenblatt Securities","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/12/hive-digital-technologie